spline hub: boss bore Oe5.40 to 3.80, then Oe4.65 BROACHED 3.80..6.30
  2.50 mm of spline engaged against a 2.00 floor (25% margin) - NO HORN | needs a Oe6.2 washer under the screw
  THAT IS THE WHOLE SPLINE. engaged = min(hub top, spline top) less the boss top, and this face is far above the spline, so it equals spline_h exactly - 2.50 on the SG90. A thicker gear buys no more of it; only a different servo would.
